- Log entry shape must stay {t, name, status:'ok'} or {t, name, status:'error', message} – no extra fields
- Existing callers depend on FIFO for same-time jobs

Ticket requirements/constraints:
- Add priority option to schedule: integer 0-9, default 5, higher runs first
- Priority only orders jobs that are due in same tick; future high-priority must never block/delay already due jobs
- Equal priority must keep FIFO via seq
